</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We thank Thee for the precious blood</l><l>That purged our sins and brought us nigh;</l><l>All cleansed and sanctified to God,</l><l>Thy holy name to magnify.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Shut in with Thee far, far above</l><l>The restless world that wars below;</l><l>We seek to learn and prove Thy love,</l><l>Thy wisdom and Thy grace to know.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The brow that once with thorns was bound</l><l>Thy hands, Thy side, we fain would see;</l><l>Draw near, Lord Jesus, glory crowned,</l><l>And bless us while we wait on Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
